# Local go.mod overrides for this image, applied at build time by go-mod-replacer
# (see Dockerfile). Example: -replace example.com/module=example.com/module@v1.2.3
#
# Prefer the global policy: add broadly-applicable CVE bumps to global_overrides.json
# in rancher/image-build-base. Keep an entry here only if it's specific to this repo.

# etcd v3.5 still uses otelgrpc.{Unary,Stream}ServerInterceptor, removed in otelgrpc v0.61.0.
# The global grpc bump drags otelgrpc to v0.6x via genproto/cloud.google.com deps; pin the
# last release that still has the interceptors.
-replace go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/instrumentation/google.golang.org/grpc/otelgrpc=go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/instrumentation/google.golang.org/grpc/otelgrpc@v0.60.0
